  "description": "<div style=\"font-family: Poppins;\"><div><p data-start=\"209\" data-end=\"569\" id=\"isPasted\"><strong data-start=\"209\" data-end=\"234\">Brand Introduction:</strong><br data-start=\"234\" data-end=\"237\">We are a wellness-driven brand focused on creating natural supplements that support cognitive health, energy, and immunity. Our mission is to make functional mushrooms accessible, enjoyable, and effective through tasty, easy-to-take gummies. Trusted by health-conscious customers worldwide, we’re redefining daily wellness routines.</p><p data-start=\"571\" data-end=\"1000\"><strong data-start=\"571\" data-end=\"597\">• Product Description:</strong><br data-start=\"597\" data-end=\"600\">Our Mushroom Fruiting Body Complex Gummies combine the power of multiple medicinal mushrooms—such as Lion’s Mane, Reishi, Cordyceps, and Chaga—sourced from 100% fruiting bodies (no mycelium or grain fillers). These gummies are vegan, non-GMO, and packed with adaptogens that support mental clarity, focus, immunity, and energy naturally. Delicious and convenient, they’re perfect for busy lifestyles.</p><p data-start=\"1002\" data-end=\"1339\"><strong data-start=\"1002\" data-end=\"1035\">• USP (Unique Selling Point):</strong><br data-start=\"1035\" data-end=\"1038\">– Made from 100% mushroom fruiting bodies for maximum potency<br data-start=\"1099\" data-end=\"1102\">– No fillers, no mycelium, no junk—just results<br data-start=\"1149\" data-end=\"1152\">– Vegan, gluten-free, and naturally flavored<br data-start=\"1196\" data-end=\"1199\">– Cognitive boost + immune support in one daily gummy<br data-start=\"1252\" data-end=\"1255\">– Already gaining traction with wellness influencers and holistic health communities</p><p data-start=\"1341\" data-end=\"1573\"><strong data-start=\"1341\" data-end=\"1361\">• Payment Terms:</strong><br data-start=\"1361\" data-end=\"1364\">Affiliates earn a competitive [20–40%] commission per sale, with 60-day cookie tracking. Payments are made via PayPal on a weekly or bi-weekly basis (depending on volume). High AOV and strong conversion rates.</p><p data-start=\"1575\" data-end=\"1927\"><strong data-start=\"1575\" data-end=\"1599\">• Other Information:</strong><br data-start=\"1599\" data-end=\"1602\">– High-converting product page + email-ready creatives provided<br data-start=\"1665\" data-end=\"1668\">– US-based fulfillment with fast, trackable shipping<br data-start=\"1720\" data-end=\"1723\">– TikTok and Instagram-friendly product with proven content hooks<br data-start=\"1788\" data-end=\"1791\">– Dedicated affiliate support and bonus perks for top performers<br data-start=\"1855\" data-end=\"1858\">– Great for health, wellness, biohacking, and lifestyle influencers</p></div></div>",
